{"q":"668","t":"Kth Smallest Number in Multiplication Table","d":"Hard","p":false,"c":"<p>Nearly everyone has used the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Multiplication_table\" target=\"_blank\">Multiplication Table</a>. The multiplication table of size <code>m x n</code> is an integer matrix <code>mat</code> where <code>mat[i][j] == i * j</code> (<strong>1-indexed</strong>).</p>\n\n<p>Given three integers <code>m</code>, <code>n</code>, and <code>k</code>, return <em>the </em><code>k<sup>th</sup></code><em> smallest element in the </em><code>m x n</code><em> multiplication table</em>.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 1:</strong></p>\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"/assets/img/b84dbd040191a81a.jpg\" style=\"width: 500px; height: 254px;\" />\n<pre>\n<strong>Input:</strong> m = 3, n = 3, k = 5\n<strong>Output:</strong> 3\n<strong>Explanation:</strong> The 5<sup>th</sup> smallest number is 3.\n</pre>\n\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 2:</strong></p>\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"/assets/img/0648f2a633e8a5dc.jpg\" style=\"width: 493px; height: 293px;\" />\n<pre>\n<strong>Input:</strong> m = 2, n = 3, k = 6\n<strong>Output:</strong> 6\n<strong>Explanation:</strong> The 6<sup>th</sup> smallest number is 6.\n</pre>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Constraints:</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><code>1 &lt;= m, n &lt;= 3 * 10<sup>4</sup></code></li>\n\t<li><code>1 &lt;= k &lt;= m * n</code></li>\n</ul>\n","h":[],"m":"{\r\n  \"name\": \"findKthNumber\",\r\n  \"params\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"name\": \"m\",\r\n      \"type\": \"integer\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"name\": \"n\",\r\n      \"type\": \"integer\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"name\": \"k\",\r\n      \"type\": \"integer\"\r\n    }\r\n  ],\r\n  \"return\": {\r\n    \"type\": \"integer\"\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n","g":[{"name":"Math","slug":"math"},{"name":"Binary Search","slug":"binary-search"}],"s":[{"t":"Kth Smallest Element in a Sorted Matrix","s":"kth-smallest-element-in-a-sorted-matrix","d":"Medium","p":false},{"t":"Find K-th Smallest Pair Distance","s":"find-k-th-smallest-pair-distance","d":"Hard","p":false},{"t":"K-th Smallest Prime Fraction","s":"k-th-smallest-prime-fraction","d":"Medium","p":false},{"t":"Minimum Time to Eat All Grains","s":"minimum-time-to-eat-all-grains","d":"Hard","p":false},{"t":"Kth Smallest Amount With Single Denomination Combination","s":"kth-smallest-amount-with-single-denomination-combination","d":"Hard","p":false}],"co":[["DE Shaw","de-shaw"],["Media.net","medianet"],["Meta","facebook"],["Bloomberg","bloomberg"],["Google","google"]],"cs":{"a":[],"b":[],"m":[["DE Shaw","de-shaw",5],["Media.net","medianet",3],["Meta","facebook",2]]}}